**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
*.md
# …except the skill shipped to users, which `copilotscope skill install` reads out of
# this image so it works without a clone. It is Markdown, and `*.md` above is read by
# some Docker versions as matching at every depth rather than only at the root; an
# empty skills/ directory in the image would fail silently, at install time, on a
# user's machine.
!skills/**
